# .gitignore
# Files listed here are ignored by Git (never saved into version history).
#
# NOTE ON API KEYS: the Alpha Vantage key is NOT stored in a file at all.
# It lives in IndexedDB on the device, entered via Settings → Market Data,
# so there is nothing for Git to accidentally pick up. The patterns below
# are a backstop in case a config file or build step is added later.

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local.js
*.local.json
config.local.*
secrets.*
*.key
*.pem

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Dependencies / build output, if a toolchain is ever added
node_modules/
dist/
build/
